<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Industrial &amp; IoT products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build" aria-label="PCBA &amp; Box Build" aria-current="page"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">PB</span><span class="label">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly" aria-label="Industrial IoT Devices"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">ID</span><span class="label">Industrial IoT Devices</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the product does and where it runs and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Industrial &amp; IoT &middot; PCBA &amp; Box Build</div><h1 class="mk-h1">PCBA and box build for industrial equipment</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana assembles ruggedized PCBAs and complete box-build units for industrial controllers, meters and monitoring equipment.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-pcba-box-build" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we build</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media" style="background:#F2F4F7;width:680px;max-width:100%;height:402px;"><img src="/images/mk-industrial-iot-card-pcba-box-build.webp" alt="Environmental metering devices, one opened to show the assembled board inside" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></div></div></section><section id="specialize-pcba-box-build" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we build</h2></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="t">Ruggedized PCBAs</span></div><div class="desc">Conformal or parylene coating, and through-hole joints by wave or selective soldering.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="t">Complete box-build units</span></div><div class="desc">Enclosure, wiring and cable assembly on automated box build lines, with functional test of the finished unit on test rigs developed in-house.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="t">High-density PCBA</span></div><div class="desc">Dense multi-layer boards on fine-pitch SMT lines, with X-ray on hidden joints.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="t">Environmental and temperature-cycle testing</span></div><div class="desc">High and low temperature cycling and environmental testing can be run in our in-house environmental chambers for real-world seal and performance testing.</div></div></div><div class="mk-moreinfo has-pic" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="midnight"><div class="txt"><div><h2>More information</h2><p>Explore the capabilities behind industrial PCBA and box build.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 20px;font-size:12px;">PCB assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/smt-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 20px;font-size:12px;">SMT Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 20px;font-size:12px;">Box Build Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></div></div><div class="pic"><img src="/images/photos/plate-industrial-smart-meter.webp" alt="Water meter in a meter pit" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></section><section style="background:#EAF2FB;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What industrial products can Hana build?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures control boards and complete assemblies for industrial controllers, meters, monitors and connected equipment. Products can be supplied as PCBAs or as complete, tested units depending on program requirements.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What protection can Hana apply for harsh environments?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Conformal and parylene coating are available, with through-hole joints where a connection carries higher current or mechanical load. Coating and test coverage are selected per program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana build high density PCBAs for infrastructure and data-center equipment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Dense multi-layer boards for infrastructure and data-center hardware are built on fine-pitch SMT lines, with X-ray used to inspect hidden joints. For AI-infrastructure work specifically, see our <a href="/markets/data-centers">Data Centers</a> market.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/industrial-iot" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Industrial &amp; IoT market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your industrial build program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

